            "gumforce_accordions_EbbYcA": {
              "type": "gumforce-accordions",
              "name": "GF Accordions",
              "settings": {
                "title_1": "How do I use it?",
                "body_1": "Chew one piece at a time. Alternate sides every few minutes to train both sides evenly. Each session should last 10–15 minutes. We recommend 3–4 pieces spread throughout the day. During your commute, at your desk, between sets, whenever.\n\nDon't overdo it. Your jaw is a muscle. You wouldn't do 6 hours of bicep curls. Same logic applies here. If you feel pain or discomfort, stop and rest. Build up gradually, especially in week one.",
                "title_2": "Does it actually work?",
                "body_2": "GUMFORCE is 10x harder than regular gum. That means real resistance on your masseter muscles — the primary muscles that define your jawline. Like any muscle, they respond to consistent training with progressive resistance.\n\nEach piece also contains 500mg of creatine monohydrate. Creatine is the most researched sports supplement in existence. The FDA officially recognizes that creatine increases physical performance in high-intensity exercise.\n\nResults come from consistency, combined with overall fitness and low body fat for visible definition.",
                "title_3": "What's in it?",
                "body_3": "Every piece contains 500mg creatine monohydrate. No fillers, no underdosing, no guessing. Unlike some creatine gummies on the market that tested for nearly zero actual creatine, what's on our label is what's in the gum.\n\nSugar-free. Dense, chewy white pieces. You'll feel the difference the second you start chewing.\n\n100g resealable pouch.",
                "title_4": "Shipping & returns",
                "body_4": "We ship worldwide. Orders are processed within 1–2 business days. Standard delivery takes 5–8 business days depending on your location. Tracking included with every order.\n\n90-day money-back guarantee. Not satisfied? Reach out and we'll make it right. We stand behind the product because we use it ourselves.",
